{"product_id":"amsterdam","title":"Amsterdam","description":"\u003cp\u003e100% Amsterdam - English edition\u003cbr\u003e\nWhether you're sightseeing, shopping, looking for good food or adventure;\u003cbr\u003e\nif you've got this guidebook in your pocket you'll discover AMSTERDAM in\u003cbr\u003e\nno time flat. The best places of interest, museums, parks, restaurants,\u003cbr\u003e\ncafÃ©s and shops are all listed for each city district. Six walks will take you\u003cbr\u003e\npast ALL THE NICEST SPOTS during the day. There are tips for what to do\u003cbr\u003e\nin the evenings and comfortable hotels to suit every pocket. The EASY-TOFOLLOW\u003cbr\u003e\nMAPS will show you where you are and where you need to be.\u003cbr\u003e\nGo shopping in the Nine Streets, examine the works of the Dutch Masters\u003cbr\u003e\nin one of the museums, admire the modern architecture of the Islands,\u003cbr\u003e\nimmerse yourself in the multicultural Pijp and the East Indian district and\u003cbr\u003e\nhave a beer in the CafÃ© Nol. 100% AMSTERDAM FOR PEOPLE WHO DON'T\u003cbr\u003e\nWANT TO MISS A THING! \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Evelien Vehof \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9789057675621 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 152\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45009018421401,"sku":"7RB9789057675621","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/f5b495bab8caba8afd96391ff7b20f6f.jpg?v=1734201260","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/amsterdam","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}